 章 Element-wise 与算子融合</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第-9-章-量化-Kernel-INT8-FP8-INT4\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/%E7%AC%AC-9-%E7%AB%A0-%E9%87%8F%E5%8C%96-Kernel-INT8-FP8-INT4/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/%E7%AC%AC-9-%E7%AB%A0-%E9%87%8F%E5%8C%96-Kernel-INT8-FP8-INT4/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第 9 章 量化 Kernel：INT8 / FP8 / INT4</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"第三篇 · GEMM 之路\" dir=\"auto\">第三篇 · GEMM 之路</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第-10-章-朴素-GEMM-与-Roofline-分析\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/%E7%AC%AC-10-%E7%AB%A0-%E6%9C%B4%E7%B4%A0-GEMM-%E4%B8%8E-Roofline-%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/%E7%AC%AC-10-%E7%AB%A0-%E6%9C%B4%E7%B4%A0-GEMM-%E4%B8%8E-Roofline-%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第 10 章 朴素 GEMM 与 Roofline 分析</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第-11-章-Tiled-GEMM-Shared-Memory-与-Double-Buffer\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/%E7%AC%AC-11-%E7%AB%A0-Tiled-GEMM-Shared-Memory-%E4%B8%8E-Double-Buffer/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/CUDA%20%E7%AE%97%E5%AD%90%E5%B7%A5%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%9A%E6%89%8B%E5%86%99%20FlashAttention%20v2%20%E4%B9%8B%E8%B7%AF/%E7%AC%AC-11-%E7%AB%A0-Tiled-GEMM-Shared-Memory-%E4%B8%8E-Double-Buffer/\" class=\"in